	(text_box "The CM5's USB2.0 host interface is used for the USB-C OTG / charge port while the onboard peripherals hub is connected to USB3_0. The CM4 only has the single USB2.0 port so for the peripherals to work you need to cut this jumper and bridge pads 2-3."
